# Everything the image must never carry: dependency trees that will be reinstalled, build
# output that will be regenerated, history, and above all any secret.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude

**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/local.properties

# The legacy Android project is reference material, not part of the web image.
mobile-android

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.idea
**/.vscode
docs
README.md
